<title>CHINA: SOCCER - CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the standings of</p>
<p>the Chinese professional soccer league after games on Sunday</p>
<p>(tabulated under games played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>goals against and points):</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	   12   10   2   0   24    5    32</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an	 12    5   5   2   24   13    20</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	 12    5   4   3   10    7    19</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing     12    4   6   2   17   10    18</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong	 12    4   4   4    9   10    16</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua     12    3   5   4   14   16    14</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	  12    3   4   5   10   13    13</p>
<p> Vanguard Huandao     12    3   3   6   13   17    12</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo     12    2   6   4    4   11    12</p>
<p> August First	   12    2   6   4    8   17    12</p>
<p> Tianjin Samsung	12    2   5   5    7   13    11</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan   12    3   2   7    9   17    11</p>
